(7760367, 1285254, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not terribly abstract. I''m sure I am not the first person to comment on that. Otherwise, an interesting cityscape with lots of detail.</td>', 'Not terribly abstract. I''m sure I am not the first person to comment on that. Otherwise, an interesting cityscape with lots of detail.', '2023-11-26 12:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7760368, 1285227, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this, but a minor critique: It would have been more abstract if you hadn''t told me what it was in the title. In typical challenges, I seem to get dinged for something that can''t be identified, but that trend tends to reverse in an abstract challenge. It won''t affect my vote, however.</td>', 'I like this, but a minor critique: It would have been more abstract if you hadn''t told me what it was in the title. In typical challenges, I seem to get dinged for something that can''t be identified, but that trend tends to reverse in an abstract challenge. It won''t affect my vote, however.', '2023-11-26 12:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7760369, 1285223, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good shot, but not abstract to me, I''m afraid. A closer macro shot of say, the pull tab might be more abstract. Sorry.</td>', 'A good shot, but not abstract to me, I''m afraid. A closer macro shot of say, the pull tab might be more abstract. Sorry.', '2023-11-26 12:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7760370, 1285196, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not totally abstract, but shot in an abstract manner, focusing my eye on the shapes, and tonality and textures. I think of these as semi abstracts.</td>', 'Not totally abstract, but shot in an abstract manner, focusing my eye on the shapes, and tonality and textures. I think of these as semi abstracts.', '2023-11-26 12:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
