(7760404, 1285196, 114285, '<td valign="top">Abstract challenges are always very interesting to vote on. They are so subjective, but of the top five this one was my favourite, although I did not like the fact that there was so much negative space to the left. Still, nevertheless, it fit the challenge the most, in my humble opinion.</td>', 'Abstract challenges are always very interesting to vote on. They are so subjective, but of the top five this one was my favourite, although I did not like the fact that there was so much negative space to the left. Still, nevertheless, it fit the challenge the most, in my humble opinion.', '2023-11-27 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
