(7760419, 1285235, 50695, '<td valign="top">a great example of people having a superficial understanding of a word.<br/> <br/>A word is not a pointer to a thing. A word is a constellation of denotations, connotations, and histories. In this case, the voters were probably thinking only of a narrow genre of photography.<br/> <br/>(or maybe it''s just their usual hatred of blur and noise but it was a good opportunity for me to point-ificate)</td>', 'a great example of people having a superficial understanding of a word. A word is not a pointer to a thing. A word is a constellation of denotations, connotations, and histories. In this case, the voters were probably thinking only of a narrow genre of photography. (or maybe it''s just their usual hatred of blur and noise but it was a good opportunity for me to point-ificate)', '2023-11-27 09:39:54.000000', NULL, 0),
